Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.25,0:00:01.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Every pimple begins in a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.71,0:00:02.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}place like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:03.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}A single pore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:05.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Acne is incredibly common.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.58,0:00:07.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}So what actually goes wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:07.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Each pore is a hair
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:11.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}follicle with an oil gland.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:12.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}The gland makes sebum, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.77,0:00:14.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}hormones called androgens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.35,0:00:15.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}can push it to make
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:15.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:17.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Skin cells lining the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}follicle should shed and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:19.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}wash out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}In acne, they pile up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:22.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}and stick together with the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:24.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}oil, forming a plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.45,0:00:25.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Inside that plug, a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:26.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}bacterium called
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:28.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Cutibacterium acnes thrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:29.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}The surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.77,0:00:31.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}It's the most common
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:32.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}bacterium on healthy skin
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:33.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}The real trouble is your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.25,0:00:36.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}immune response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:38.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}Inflammation is what turns a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}clogged pore into a red,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:40.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}swollen pimple.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:42.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}So acne isn't caused by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:44.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}dirt. It's oil, clogging,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.73,0:00:46.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}bacteria and inflammation,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:48.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}together. That's why
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.06,0:00:49.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}guidelines strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.43,0:00:51.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}recommend benzoyl peroxide
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:52.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}and topical retinoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.35,0:00:54.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}And if your acne is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:56.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}painful, scarring, or not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.24,0:00:57.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}improving, a dermatologist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:00:58.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,40)}can help.
